WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.120
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.577
SHANG-CHI: Oh God.

00:00:02.577 --> 00:00:03.890
KATY: Hold on, everybody!

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:08.450
[SQUEALING]

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:13.038
[SCREAMING]

00:00:13.038 --> 00:00:13.905
KATY: We make a good team.

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:21.630
[ADVENTUROUS MUSIC]

00:00:44.848 --> 00:00:46.330
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.282
[FIGHTING NOISES]

00:00:53.076 --> 00:00:57.896
[GRUNTING AND FIGHTING NOISES]

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:04.389
[CRACKLING]

00:01:04.389 --> 00:01:05.371
SHANG-CHI: Katy, go, go, go!

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:12.290
TREVOR SLATTERY: Morris
says, "hard right on three."

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:13.420
KATY: What?
TREVOR SLATTERY: Two--

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.687
SHANG-CHI: Hard right where?

00:01:14.687 --> 00:01:15.487
TREVOR SLATTERY: Now.

00:01:15.487 --> 00:01:18.974
[MECHANICAL NOISES]

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.890
[ACTION MUSIC]

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:26.135
KATY: I'm driving.

00:01:26.135 --> 00:01:27.130
SHANG-CHI: No, you're not.

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:28.242
Katy--

00:01:28.242 --> 00:01:30.490
[ZOOM]

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.380
SHANG-CHI: [YELLING]

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:33.580
[ZOOM]

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.780
[SCREECHING TIRES]

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:35.980
[ZOOM]

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.480
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:19.180
[FIGHT NOISES]

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:44.130
[FIGHT NOISES]

